config IIO_SC2720_AUXADC_UMS9117
	bool "SC2720 AUXADC on UMS9117"
	depends on ARCH_UMS9117
	depends on IIO
	help
	  Direct raw AUXADC readings for channels 0, 1, 2, 4 and 14 on the
	  UMS9117 analog-die interface. The provider performs one bounded conversion
	  per read and does not configure interrupts, buffers, triggers or
	  persistent ADC state.
